source: tests/regression.rs
expression: sandbox.run(&arguments)
---
exit code: 0
--- stdout
Serve the memory to agents over MCP

Usage: casulo memory serve [OPTIONS] --dir <DIR> --workspace <WORKSPACE>

Options:
      --dir <DIR>              The memory directory, holding memory.sqlite and notes/
      --workspace <WORKSPACE>  The repository to index
      --host <HOST>            Address to listen on; the memory container uses 0.0.0.0 on its internal network [default: 127.0.0.1]
      --port <PORT>            Port to listen on [default: 7373]
  -h, --help                   Print help
